    "detailed_description": "A soft gel and a hard tank.<br />\r\nTwo things combine to make a 'Gel tank'!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJump, shoot, climb walls, and seize boarding weapons.<br />\r\nDefeat the swarm of enemies and conquer the stage with simple actions!<br />\r\nYou can use the jewels you pick up along the way as currency to buy skills in the shop and customize your character!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can collect the captured creature &quot;Nekodoru Fuin&quot; and combos that go up when you defeat enemies with no damage.<br />\r\nCollect achievement badges that can be earned by fulfilling conditions in a stage.<br />\r\nYou can also collect achievement badges that can be earned by fulfilling conditions in the stage, as well as time attacks that are performed with limited skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story is colored by the intercepted enemy communications along the stage path.<br />\r\nExperience the seemingly lurid worldview with your own hands!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe 16-bit retro-style graphics can be selected from the options screen. You can experience even more nostalgia with a cathode ray tube style filter!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are welcome to make, post, and distribute videos of yourself playing this game, as well as fan art and other fan activities!",
    "about_the_game": "A soft gel and a hard tank.<br />\r\nTwo things combine to make a 'Gel tank'!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJump, shoot, climb walls, and seize boarding weapons.<br />\r\nDefeat the swarm of enemies and conquer the stage with simple actions!<br />\r\nYou can use the jewels you pick up along the way as currency to buy skills in the shop and customize your character!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can collect the captured creature &quot;Nekodoru Fuin&quot; and combos that go up when you defeat enemies with no damage.<br />\r\nCollect achievement badges that can be earned by fulfilling conditions in a stage.<br />\r\nYou can also collect achievement badges that can be earned by fulfilling conditions in the stage, as well as time attacks that are performed with limited skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story is colored by the intercepted enemy communications along the stage path.<br />\r\nExperience the seemingly lurid worldview with your own hands!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe 16-bit retro-style graphics can be selected from the options screen. You can experience even more nostalgia with a cathode ray tube style filter!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are welcome to make, post, and distribute videos of yourself playing this game, as well as fan art and other fan activities!",
    "short_description": "Casual but profound! Simple, authentic 16-bit 2D style that will satisfy everyone from beginners to experts The action shooter is here! Dive into the soft and hard world of the ultimate 16-bit world, down to the resolution! Ugh!",
